{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":18085,\"date\":\"2026-09-26T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-26T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"come-controllare-data-di-produzione-mac-macos-27\",\"title\":\"Come controllare la data di produzione del tuo Mac in macOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Con macOS 27 Golden Gate puoi risalire alla data di produzione del tuo Mac tramite la sezione “Regulatory Certification” nel System Report.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/2026-mac-mini-blue-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"2026-mac-mini-blue\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17999,\"date\":\"2026-09-22T22:20:47+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-22T20:20:47+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-watch-series-10-vs-series-12-guida-aggiornamento\",\"title\":\"Apple Watch Series 10 vs Series 12: guida all’upgrade\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple Watch Series 12 introduce un nuovo chip, RAM doppia, sensori salute ridisegnati, 5G e nuove funzioni audio. Ecco quando conviene davvero passare da Series 10.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/apple-watch-series-10-gold-titanium-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-watch-series-10-gold-titanium\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17964,\"date\":\"2026-09-21T22:57:12+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-21T20:57:12+00:00\",\"slug\":\"pin-music-in-cima-alla-libreria-su-apple-watch-come-funziona\",\"title\":\"Pin Music in cima alla libreria su Apple Watch: come funziona\",\"excerpt\":\"Con watchOS 27 e un abbonamento Apple Music, puoi fissare brani, artisti, album e playlist in cima alla libreria dell’Apple Watch per trovarli e avviarli più velocemente.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/pin-music-library-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"pin-music-library\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17956,\"date\":\"2026-09-21T21:50:24+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-21T19:50:24+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-14-pro-vs-iphone-18-pro-guida-alla-upgrade\",\"title\":\"iPhone 14 Pro vs iPhone 18 Pro: guida all’upgrade\",\"excerpt\":\"Dopo quattro generazioni, iPhone 18 Pro porta display più grandi, USB‑C, ricarica più rapida, nuove fotocamere, più autonomia e supporto ad Apple Intelligence. Ecco quando conviene davvero passare da iPhone 14 Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iphone-14-pro-vs-iphone-18-pro-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-14-pro-vs-iphone-18-pro\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17949,\"date\":\"2026-09-21T12:25:09+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-21T10:25:09+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ifixit-pubblica-teardown-iphone-18-pro-nuove-funzionalita\",\"title\":\"iFixit pubblica il teardown di iPhone 18 Pro: ecco cosa emerge\",\"excerpt\":\"Un teardown di iPhone 18 Pro offre uno sguardo ravvicinato all’hardware e alle novità interne del dispositivo, con l’analisi di iFixit sulle componenti e sulla struttura del telefono.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iFixit-iPhone-18-Pro-Teardown-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iFixit-iPhone-18-Pro-Teardown\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17886,\"date\":\"2026-09-18T09:33:40+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-18T07:33:40+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-15-pro-vs-iphone-18-pro-guida-aggiornamento\",\"title\":\"iPhone 15 Pro vs iPhone 18 Pro: guida all’upgrade\",\"excerpt\":\"Tre generazioni di cambiamenti separano iPhone 15 Pro e iPhone 18 Pro: display più grandi, design rinnovato, fotocamere migliorate, autonomia più lunga e ricarica più rapida. Ecco quando conviene davvero passare al nuovo modello.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iphone-15-pro-vs-iphone-18-pro-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-15-pro-vs-iphone-18-pro\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17846,\"date\":\"2026-09-17T12:24:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-17T10:24:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-watch-ultra-3-vs-ultra-4-guida-all-acquisto\",\"title\":\"Apple Watch Ultra 3 vs Ultra 4: guida all’acquisto\",\"excerpt\":\"Ultra 4 in pre-order: nuovo sistema di rilevazione della salute, più memoria e autonomia estesa. Confronto completo con Ultra 3 e consigli per scegliere.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/apple-watch-ultra-3-and-ultra-4-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-watch-ultra-3-and-ultra-4\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17823,\"date\":\"2026-09-17T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-17T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-16-pro-vs-iphone-18-pro-buyers-guide-valga-lupgrade\",\"title\":\"iPhone 16 Pro vs. iPhone 18 Pro: Buyer’s Guide, vale l’upgrade?\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha introdotto iPhone 18 Pro e iPhone 18 Pro Max due anni dopo i 16 Pro. Tra chip A20 Pro, fotocamera con apertura variabile, modem C2 e soprattutto autonomia record, ecco quando conviene davvero passare.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iPhone-16-Pro-vs-18-Pro-Buyers-Guide-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-16-Pro-vs-18-Pro-Buyers-Guide-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17770,\"date\":\"2026-09-15T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-15T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-vs-iphone-18-pro-max-guida-acquisto\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro vs iPhone 18 Pro Max: guida all’acquisto\",\"excerpt\":\"Con A20 Pro, display OLED Super Retina XDR e fotocamera Pro Fusion da 48 MP, le due versioni differiscono soprattutto per dimensioni, autonomia e modem. Ecco come scegliere tra iPhone 18 Pro e iPhone 18 Pro Max.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iPhone-18-Pro-Burgundy-Feature-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-18-Pro-Burgundy-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17716,\"date\":\"2026-09-13T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-13T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"come-ricaricare-iphone-18-pro-alla-massima-velocita-caricatori-e-cavi-giusti\",\"title\":\"Come ricaricare iPhone 18 Pro alla massima velocità: caricatori e cavi giusti\",\"excerpt\":\"Per sfruttare la ricarica più rapida di iPhone 18 Pro serve la combinazione corretta di caricatore e cavo. Ecco cosa usare per ottenere la massima velocità.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iphone-18-pro-fast-charge-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-18-pro-fast-charge-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17452,\"date\":\"2026-09-05T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-05T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"m6-vs-m5-pro-guida-acquisto-mac-mini\",\"title\":\"M6 vs M5 Pro: guida all’acquisto del Mac mini\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple porta il chip M6 nel Mac mini entry-level e il M5 Pro nel modello più potente. Ecco differenze reali, limiti di memoria e scelte consigliate.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/mac-mini-2026-blue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"mac-mini-2026-blue\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17417,\"date\":\"2026-09-03T12:24:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-03T10:24:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"aprire-impostazioni-app-attiva-centro-di-controllo-iphone\",\"title\":\"Aprire le impostazioni dell’app attiva da Centro di Controllo su iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Un trucco basato su una Shortcut permette di aprire rapidamente il menu delle impostazioni dell’app attualmente in uso su iPhone, direttamente da Centro di Controllo (o dal pulsante Azione).\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iOS-Shortcuts-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-Shortcuts-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null}],\"totalPages\":3}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":["tj-posts"]}